      "title": "tshark: improve robustness for PCAPNGs not starting with IDBs",
      "message": "tshark: improve robustness for PCAPNGs not starting with IDBs\n\nThe PCAPNG code assumes that PCAPNGs start with IDBs, which might not be\ntrue. This patch adds a workaround for Tshark to process such files.\n",
      "author_name": "Dr. Lars Völker",
      "author_email": "lars.voelker@technica-engineering.de",
